Groups:
Abbreviations: 
0-fold, nonsynonymous sites;
2-fold, two fold degenerate sites;
4-fold, four fold degenerate sites;
BPS, base-pair substitution; 
inter, intergenic region;
m, mutation bias to the A/T direction: G/C>A/T ÷ A/T>G/C mutation rate; 
MA, mutation accumulation; 
Multicellular eukaryotes, multicellular eukaryotes; 
neutral, G/C content based on the neutral expectation, i.e. G/C content solely determined by mutation rate;
S, population-scaled selection strength;

1 Based on list of base substitutions in the supplemental materials; 
2 CC2344 and CC2931 are excluded due to presence of mutator lines;  
3 Mean mutation rate of three human populations; 
4 Mutation rate per erythrocytic life cycle per site; 
5 Standard error (SE) was calculated by following formula A1.19a Lynch & Walsh (1998) page 818, assuming no covariance, 95% confidence interval was calculated by neutral expectation ± 1.96 _ SE 
6 All standard errors of these G/C compositions are < 0.001
